# Cloudflare Pages redirects. One rule per line: <from> <to> <status>
#
# The About page was retired on 2026-09-03. Its founding story and the three
# values moved onto the Platform page, so anything already linking to /about.html
# lands on the section it was looking for rather than a 404.
/about.html   /platform.html#why   301
/about        /platform.html#why   301

# The pilot page is temporarily disabled while the team confirms its details and
# data (2026-09-07). Serves the 404 page with a real 404 status rather than
# redirecting, so the URL is not treated as permanently moved. Delete this rule
# and the two lines in use-cases.html's <head> to bring it back.
/use-cases.html   /404.html   404
